// probe: stated
// about: a bare `return` ends the epilogue of an accessor with two lend sites early, in each position, sync and suspending (SL-870)
// stage 0: cannot parse a `borrow` block
// speeds: -O0 -O2
// leaks: none
// prints: straight quiet=true i=0
// prints: epilogue t1
// prints: drop t1
// prints: straight quiet=true i=1
// prints: epilogue t1
